    <TD STYLE="text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: right"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">0.34-1.00</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
